WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:03.210
Every dataset has a story in it.

2
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:06.860
But getting it onto the page? That's the struggle.

3
00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:09.980
Some tools are easy, but only go so far.

4
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.420
Others can do anything, once you learn to code.

5
00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.940
So a professor built something in between.

6
00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:17.550
Pandion Plots.

7
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:21.990
Drop in your variables, and your first draft is already presentable.

8
00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:25.500
Want to change something? Just click it.

9
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:30.010
The statistics sit right beside it, explained in plain language.

10
00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:33.170
It even checks your graph for common mistakes.

11
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:38.370
Free, open source, and private. Your data never leaves your computer.

12
00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:41.930
Built for research. Designed to teach.

13
00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:51.750
Pandion Plots. Clear statistical figures, without the struggle.

